  "description": "Please find the current client configuration below. The autogenerated API key is **b7f3a9c2-4d1e-4f8b-9c6a-2e5d7f1a6b3c**, and its hashed secret is **e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855**. All cross\u2011origin requests must originate from the domain **example.com**.\n\nFor access control, the client is permitted to perform the following actions: **GET:/public**, **POST:/submit**, and any request marked with a wildcard (**\\***). Conversely, the client is explicitly denied **DELETE:/admin** and **PATCH:/secret**.\n\nActive sessions are recorded as follows: **sessionA** holds the token **abc123def456ghi789** and was created on **2024-05-20T14:30:00Z**; **sessionB** holds the token **jkl012mno345pqr678** and was created on **2024-05-21T09:15:00Z**."
